# pnpm configuration for the criador-de-cms monorepo.
#
# public-hoist-pattern: expose selected transitive dependencies at the top-level
# node_modules so that workspace code importing them directly (as it did under
# npm's flat layout in the standalone repo) keeps resolving. The demo-corp
# workspace's vitest.config.ts imports `@next/env` directly — a transitive dep
# of `next` — so it must be hoisted under pnpm's stricter non-flat layout.
public-hoist-pattern[]=@next/*

# Keep the lockfile centralized at the root (S1.1). Frozen in CI (S1.5).
